---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Shree Om Sai Packaging" description="Terms and conditions for using Shree Om Sai Packaging services." canonical="https://www.sospackaging.com/terms">

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[860px] mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-10">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using the services provided by Shree Om Sai Packaging ("Shree Om Sai Packaging," "we," "us," or "our"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">2. Products and Orders</h2>
        <p>All orders for steel cable drums, spools, and related products are subject to acceptance by Shree Om Sai Packaging. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order at our discretion. Product specifications, weights, and dimensions are provided as guidelines and may vary based on manufacturing tolerances.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">3. Pricing and Payment</h2>
        <p>Prices are quoted on a per-order basis and are valid for the period stated in the quotation. Payment terms are agreed upon at the time of order placement. Shree Om Sai Packaging reserves the right to modify prices with reasonable notice.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
