        <p>Delivery schedules are estimated and not guaranteed. Shree Om Sai Packaging is not liable for delays caused by circumstances beyond our reasonable control, including but not limited to transportation disruptions, raw material shortages, or force majeure events.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">5. Returns and Refunds</h2>
        <p>Returns are accepted only for manufacturing defects reported within 7 days of delivery. Custom-manufactured drums and spools are non-returnable unless otherwise agreed in writing. Refunds will be processed after inspection and approval of the returned product.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>Shree Om Sai Packaging shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use our products. Our total liability is limited to the purchase price of the product in question.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Alwar, Rajasthan.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, please contact us at <span class="text-primary-container font-semibold">info@sospackaging.com</span> or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary-container underline hover:no-underline">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
